DTSTAMP:20260926T150052Z
UID:1457be00f6026a7f782d7f195bed09@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:September is Vermont Archaeology Month! Celebrate by joining u
 s at Archaeology Discovery Day on September 26\, 2026 11am-2pm at the Etha
 n Allen Homestead Museum. Admission is free! Lots of family-fun activities
 : *Join a real archaeological dig! *Historical reenactors in the historic 
 Allen House *Hands-on artifacts -- really found in archaeological digs on 
 site! *Family-fun activities *Costume Corner (*visitor favorite*) This pro
 gram is in partnership with the Vermont Archaeological Society and is part
  of the Vermont Archaeological Heritage Center's Vermont Archaeology Month
  (September). You can learn more about archaeology at the Ethan Allen Home
 stead here: https://ethanallenhomestead.org/history/archaeology/ Thank you
  to Vermont Humanities and the Vermont 250th Commission for their financia
 l support of our 250th reenactment programs\, and to our Homestead Communi
 ty Enrichment sponsors: Richard & Lynda Smarg\, M&T Bank\, Northfield Savi
 ngs Banks. You can donate to support programs like this at: www.ethanallen
 homestead.org/support-us Ethan Allen Homestead Museum\n\nSources: Vermont 
 Public
LOCATION:Vermont Public is independent\, community-supported media\, servi
 ng Vermont with trusted\, relevant and essential information. We share sto
 ries that bring people together\, from every corner of our region.\, © 20
 26 Vermont Public | 365 Troy Ave. Colchester\, VT 05446
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/archaeolog
 y-discovery-day-08-09-2026-11-06-52
