DESCRIPTION:In this accessible and open-to-everyone presentation\, JuanCar
 los will speak to his relationship with Vermont\, and how it has shaped th
 e way he photographs here\, along with how the light\, weather\, seasons a
 nd place influence his work. He’ll also share a few behind-the-scenes st
 ories about some of the pieces in his exhibit\, and talk a little about hi
 s personal interest in people\, place and sense of belonging. A Q & A with
  JuanCarlos will follow his presentation. Free but due to space constraint
 s\, registration is required.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
