BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FALL FEST for Safe and Happy Childhoods
DTSTART:20260926T100000
DTEND:20260926T140000
DTSTAMP:20260926T150052Z
UID:c7a0c1349dee2f31387d2f96575d8b@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The FALL FEST for Safe and Happy Childhoods brings friends and
  families from across the state to enjoy a day of family fun and activitie
 s. FALL FEST combines the energy of a classic field day with the charm of 
 a Vermont fall festival — featuring live music and entertainment\, child
 ren’s activities\, field games\, interactive partner booths\, food truck
 s\, and meaningful community engagement. A key component of the FALL FEST 
 are the partner organizations that spread out on the lawn\, providing impo
 rtant information for parents and community members while offering fun act
 ivities for attendees. Last year the following partners joined us: Buildin
 g Bright Futures\, Voices for Vermont Children\, VT Association for Educat
 ion of Young Children\, Vermont Guardian Ad Litem Program\, KidSafe Vermon
 t\, Center for Crime Victim Services\, and many others. One partner said 
 “I thought it was a fabulous event…It was a pleasure to attend and I w
 ould be happy to table again next year. Thank you for inviting us.” This
  year there will be 3-4 musical performances including fiddlers from The S
 ummit School\, roving entertainment\, and fun lawn games such as corn hole
 \, parachutes and hula hoops. The entire event is free to attend and peopl
 e of all ages are welcome. The FALL FEST is both a joyful community event 
 and a powerful public demonstration of Vermont’s commitment to ensuring 
 that every child grows up safe\, supported\, and connected.\n\nSources: Ve
 rmont Public
LOCATION:Vermont State House\, 115 State St
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/fall-fest-
 for-safe-and-happy-childhoods-18-06-2026-22-52-33
END:VEVENT
